{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every leap and every dodge tells a story. In <i>Testimony of Shew</i>, you\u2019ll navigate breathtaking landscapes, unravel a compelling narrative, and master precise movement to overcome challenges.\u00a0This is not a game, its an experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storytelling:</strong> Experience a deeply immersive tale woven into the platforming action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Jump &amp; Dodge Mechanics:</strong> Precision movement is your key to survival\u2014evade hazards, traverse obstacles, and uncover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Explore beautifully crafted levels designed to challenge your reflexes and unravel the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Art &amp; Atmosphere:</strong> Lose yourself in a visually striking world filled with mystery and emotion.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644250?t=1761504724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644250/3c9591e5b9e2f4feb25a359aa507217ef886bfae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761504724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644250/ff7abe2a81768c386fdbafe4b109e102397bc3d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761504724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644250/ff7abe2a81768c386fdbafe4b109e102397bc3d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761504724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"drug and alcohol abuse"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every leap and every dodge tells a story. In <i>Testimony of Shew</i>, you\u2019ll navigate breathtaking landscapes, u